  "data_abstract": "The measurement of coherent $K^+K^-$ photoproduction\nin ultra-peripheral Pb$-$Pb collisions at $\\sqrt{s_\\mathrm{NN}}$ = 5.02 TeV is presented. These\nresults are based on the data sample collected by the ALICE detector during the\n2015 LHC Pb$-$Pb run.\n",
